Given $x = -2$ find the value of $2x^2+3x+4$.
We substitute $x = -2$ into the expression $2x^2+3x+4$:
$2(-2)^2 + 3(-2) + 4 = 2(4) - 6 + 4 = 8 - 6 + 4 = 2 + 4 = 6$.

\boxed{6}

