To convert $8888_{10}$ to base-8, we can use the division algorithm repeatedly.
\begin{align*} 8888 \div 8 &= 1111 \text{ R } 0 \\ 1111 \div 8 &= 138 \text{ R } 7 \\ 138 \div 8 &= 17 \text{ R } 2 \\ 17 \div 8 &= 2 \text{ R } 1 \\ 2 \div 8 &= 0 \text{ R } 2 \end{align*}
Reading the remainders from bottom to top, we find that $8888_{10} = 21270_8$.
The sum of the digits is $2+1+2+7+0 = 12$.

\boxed{12}

\boxed{12}

