\begin{align*} 8888 \div 8 &= 1111 \text{ with remainder } 0 \\ 1111 \div 8 &= 138 \text{ with remainder } 7 \\ 138 \div 8 &= 17 \text{ with remainder } 2 \\ 17 \div 8 &= 2 \text{ with remainder } 1 \\ 2 \div 8 &= 0 \text{ with remainder } 2 \end{align*} 
Reading the remainders from bottom to top, we get $8888_{10} = 21270_8$.

The digits in the base-8 expression are 2, 1, 2, 7, 0. The sum of the digits is $2 + 1 + 2 + 7 + 0 = 12$.

